Zero point energy                ...      0.13287682 Eh      83.38 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01050436 Eh       6.59 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
